\f0\b\fs28 \cf5 \cb6 \strokec5 One-sentence summary:
\f1\b0  this project will take one big research question, split it into smaller questions, research those pieces in parallel, assemble a report, and then verify every factual claim against the source that supposedly supports it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs42 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 1. The problem this project solves\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs28 \cf5 \strokec5 Imagine asking: 
\f2\i \'93Should India invest more in renewable energy?\'94
\f1\i0  A normal chatbot may write a convincing answer, but it can invent figures, mix up sources, or attach a citation that does not actually support the sentence next to it.\
This platform treats research as a workflow rather than one giant AI prompt:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Break the broad question into smaller, independent sub-questions.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Search trusted sources and collect clean text.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Let several researcher workers work in parallel.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Build a report from structured claims instead of untraceable prose.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Send every factual claim back through a critic that checks its original source and stores the supporting passage.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf5 The last step is the special part. A report is not considered trustworthy merely because it has footnotes. Each factual statement must be checkable against specific evidence.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

