\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 DAG dependencies between sub-questions. The database reserves fields for them, but every current task stays at level 0.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Contradiction reconciliation, multi-provider search routing, rich UI, multi-user billing, and early CI/CD/VM deployment.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Kubernetes, service mesh, API gateway, Terraform, and extra services during the core month.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
