\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16380 \cf8 \strokec8 Source quality tiers\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs28 \cf5 \strokec5 The current YAML configuration classifies sources before agents use them:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Tier 1:
\f1\b0  exact primary/official sources currently including PIB, RBI, and ISRO.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Tier 2:
\f1\b0  exact reputable journalism domains currently including The Hindu, Indian Express, and NDTV.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Tier 3:
\f1\b0  the safe default for any unknown domain.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Tier 4:
\f1\b0  pattern-matched low-confidence sources, currently Blogspot and WordPress-hosted blogs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf5 The resolver strips 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 www.
\f1\fs28 \cb1 , lowercases a URL\'92s host, checks the exact lists, then checks the glob patterns. Its tests cover a tier-1 domain, a tier-2 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 www
\f1\fs28 \cb1  URL, Blogspot, WordPress, and an unknown default.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs42 \cf2 \strokec2 10. Important conventions and guardrails\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\fs28 \cf5 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Migration first, entity second:
\f1\b0  write reviewed Flyway SQL before creating JPA entities. Hibernate validates rather than silently edits production-like schemas.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Constructor injection only:
\f1\b0  dependencies arrive in constructors, not hidden field injection.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Records rather than Lombok:
\f1\b0  DTOs and agent contracts are immutable, explicit Java data types.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 HTTP for short lookups; Kafka for durable work:
\f1\b0  services call retrieval over HTTP, but researcher/writer hops use Kafka because they can take 5\'9690 seconds and must survive restarts.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Version cache keys:
\f1\b0  use prefixes such as 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 search:v1:
\f1\fs28 \cb1 . When cache semantics change, bump the version instead of trying to delete every old key.\
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Tests should prefer Testcontainers:
\f1\b0  later integration tests should use real disposable dependencies instead of mocks that pretend Redis/Kafka/Postgres behave more simply than they do.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs42 \cf2 \strokec2 11. Known traps and live documentation discrepancies\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf5 \cb16 \strokec5 Current Maven compiler setting:
\f1\b0  the live root 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 pom.xml
\f1\fs28 \cb16  inspected for this guide contains 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 <java.version>21</java.version>
\f1\fs28 \cb16 , but does not currently show 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 <maven.compiler.release>$\{java.version\}</maven.compiler.release>
\f1\fs28 \cb16 . The session log says that property was added earlier to fix \'93records are not supported in source 8.\'94 Before relying on Java records through Maven, verify/restore that property and reload Maven in IntelliJ.\

\f0\b Spring Boot version mismatch:
\f1\b0  the live Maven BOM pins Spring Boot 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 4.1.0
\f1\fs28 \cb16 . Some narrative instruction files still say Spring Boot 3.3.x and Spring AI 1.0. Treat the live 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 pom.xml
\f1\fs28 \cb16  as the build truth; the narrative stack line needs later cleanup.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf5 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 In Spring Boot 4.x, 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 flyway-core
\f1\fs28 \cb1  alone did not trigger Flyway auto-configuration. The fixed dependency is 
\f4\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cb11 spring-boot-starter-flyway
\f1\fs28 \cb1 , with the PostgreSQL Flyway module retained.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 SearXNG serves HTML by default. Its mounted configuration must explicitly allow JSON.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 The SearXNG container owns port 8080. The three Spring apps must use 8081, 8082, and 8083.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 IntelliJ can retain stale Maven/classpath state. After dependency or compiler-property changes, use 
\f2\i Reload All Maven Projects
\f1\i0 ; delegating build/run actions to Maven avoids an IDE-vs-terminal mismatch.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Postgres-backed tests require Docker Desktop and the Compose Postgres container to be running.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

