\f1\b0\fs28 \cf5 \strokec5 By the end, a person should be able to clone the project, start the local stack, submit a question, watch several researchers work, read a report, and click a claim to see the exact passage that supports or contradicts it. The strongest demo is not \'93the AI wrote a report.\'94 It is: 
\f0\b \'93the system can prove where each factual sentence came from, and it catches an intentionally injected fabrication.\'94
